  "notes": "<p>Trey teased Let It Grow in No Men In No Man&#39;s Land. Leaves was performed for the first time since September 3, 2017 (103 shows). Trey teased Super Bad in Tube. Ha Ha Ha was performed for the first time since August 6, 2017 (106 shows). Chalk Dust Torture was unfinished. The Gorge Song in the soundcheck was improvised with Trey making up lyrics about the Gorge. This was the rescheduled date from the show that had been postponed due to the coronavirus COVID-19 outbreak in 2020.</p>",
